Generates `*_hooks.go` files for any resources that require hooks (BeforeCreate, AfterCreate, BeforeUpdate, etc.)

~~You'll need to create the `resource_hooks` folder yourself since it doesn't generate the directory, only the files meant for `resource_hooks` folder.~~ This prevented the methods to be called in the CRUD functions, they're now generated in the same folder as all the other generated files.

In order for the hooks file to only generate when needed, I added a `hooks` block so that it would only generate if the block actually has fields that are set to true. This also applies to both the `before` and `after` blocks. The file will not be generated if they are both empty.

example:
```
    autocrud_options {
      wait_for_deletion = true
      hooks{
          before {
            create = true
            read = true
          }
          after {
            create = true
          }
        } 
    }
```

